  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Moffat**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Black Tooth**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Danger Money**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Hot Wax [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2014-10-31.nyctaper.matrix.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 9 songs; 44 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2014-10-31.nyctaper.matrix.flac16**: taped by nyctaper; source: Soundboard [engineer Roland] + Sennheiser MKH-8040s > Edirol R-44 (Oade Concert Mod) > 2 x 24bit 48kHz wav files [1]. Also: Audio was processed in Soundforge for levels and mixed down to stereo before CDWave tracking; Final files were converted to FLAC and tagged with Foobar after 320 MP3 creation [1]",
